---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import data from '../../data/pois.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="About · The Unofficial Rick Mercer Atlas">
  <article class="page-shell prose-page">
    <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">About the archive</p><h1>Canada is better with a few detours.</h1><p>This independent fan project preserves a remarkable map of {data.pois.length} adventures across fifteen seasons.</p></header>
    <section><h2>What this is</h2><p>This is an unofficial, non-commercial archive created to make the original Atlas fast, accessible and useful on modern devices. It is not affiliated with, authorized by, or endorsed by Rick Mercer, CBC, or the programme’s rights holders.</p></section>
    <section><h2>How the archive works</h2><p>Programme metadata and locations were recovered from the original public Atlas, normalized, and checked automatically. Videos remain on YouTube and belong to their respective rights holders. Locations may be approximate.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Corrections and rights</h2><p>See something inaccurate, unavailable, or concerning? <a href={import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ISSUES_URL || '#'}>Open a request in our public issue tracker</a>. Requests concerning rights or removal will be prioritized.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Privacy</h2><p>There are no accounts, ads or application analytics. “Near me” runs only after you ask for it and is not retained. YouTube is loaded only when you press Play.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
